<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;One possibility:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
=pod

=for comment
Foo!

Or:

=begin comment

Bar!

=end comment

=cut
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also seem to have a dim memory of someone suggesting &lt;c&gt;=begin internal&lt;/c&gt; for marking things that are actually still documentation, but internal docs, but I'm not sure when/where that was.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
